            "value": "Release 默认只记录信息级及以上；开启后记录调试级事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅记录主机名，不记录路径、查询参数或账号信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only host names are recorded; paths, query strings and account details are not."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
