        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该网站已被「自动填充域名规则」屏蔽。可在 Monica 设置 → 自动填充中调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些规则只影响 Monica 自己提供的自动填充候选和凭据标识。系统设置里其它密码管理器、以及你在系统面板中手动选择的其它来源都不受影响。规则保存在本机 Keychain，不写入日志，也不进入备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These rules only affect the autofill candidates and credential identities that Monica itself provides. Other password managers in system settings, and other sources you pick manually in the system panel, are unaffected. Rules are stored in the local Keychain, never in logs, and are not included in backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则只影响 Monica 自己提供的自动填充候选和凭据标识。系统设置里其它密码管理器、以及你在系统面板中手动选择的其它来源都不受影响。规则保存在本机 Keychain，不写入日志，也不进入备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动填充域名规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autofill domain rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动填充域名规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法从钥匙串读取笔记草稿密钥，草稿暂时无法保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot read the note draft key from the keychain, so drafts cannot be saved right now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法从钥匙串读取笔记草稿密钥，草稿暂时无法保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "笔记草稿密钥长度不正确，已拒绝使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note draft key has an invalid length and was rejected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "笔记草稿密钥长度不正确，已拒绝使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display Mode"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持常用 Markdown 子集：标题、列表、引用、代码、强调与链接；不支持完整 CommonMark。外部图片不会自动加载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports a Markdown subset: headings, lists, quotes, code, emphasis, and links. Full CommonMark is not supported, and external images are never loaded automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持常用 Markdown 子集：标题、列表、引用、代码、强调与链接；不支持完整 CommonMark。外部图片不会自动加载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法插入图片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot Insert Image"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法插入图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用 Markdown 写笔记，例如 # 标题、- 列表、> 引用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write your note in Markdown, e.g. # Heading, - List, > Quote"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 Markdown 写笔记，例如 # 标题、- 列表、> 引用"
